      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T19:04:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch disables trapping of access to MAPM0_EL1/MPAM1_EL1 and MPAMIDR_EL1 from EL1 to EL2. This is a bare minimum of changes required to enable MPAM support (note that by default MPAM will be disabled when booting at EL2).\nActual \u0027sample\u0027 implementation of MPAM module can be found at:\nhttps://gitlab.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-power/-/merge_requests/1",
      "revId": "e6f7dfcdb13a1a80f3f918d8bdc4dec558b8f458",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9c434b78_9b832dd0",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/el2_setup.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 181,
      "author": {
        "id": 1729538
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T09:05:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it makes much sense to hide this behind some Android-specific config:\n- Nothing here is Android specific\n- It shouldn\u0027t cause any harm\n- It is positively tiny and only executed once per boot per CPU.",
      "revId": "e6f7dfcdb13a1a80f3f918d8bdc4dec558b8f458",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bfa45e1c_6ef87a43",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/el2_setup.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 181,
      "author": {
        "id": 1348429
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T10:23:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should be harmless indeed as long as EL3 setup (if EL3 is implemented) disabled trapping accesses to MPAM sys regs on lower levels. So it might be safer to keep those under control (with config option) case the MPAM feature itself is implemented (as per ID_AA64PRF0_EL1) but still not actually supported (?)",
      "parentUuid": "9c434b78_9b832dd0",
      "revId": "e6f7dfcdb13a1a80f3f918d8bdc4dec558b8f458",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "05d0b8d1_a7a8aa75",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/include/asm/el2_setup.h",
