        "id": 1729538
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T10:33:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d have the exact opposite argument. The sooner we detect these broken systems, the better. By making sure these systems explode early, we have a chance to fix them. Also, in a GKI world, we\u0027d need to have this enabled anyway. Given that, the option should go.",
      "parentUuid": "bfa45e1c_6ef87a43",
      "revId": "e6f7dfcdb13a1a80f3f918d8bdc4dec558b8f458",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
